                  "markdown":  "---\nname: standup-digest\ndescription: Convert bounded work events into a source-mapped standup digest.\nsource:\n  type: cli-tool\n  command: node\n  args:\n    - run.mjs\nrunx:\n  category: ops\n---\n\n# Standup Digest\n\nGroup bounded work events into shipped work, blockers, risks, and next actions.\nEvery output item maps back to the event ids it came from.\n\nThis skill does not read calendars, GitHub, Slack, or inboxes directly. A caller\nmust provide the bounded event packet.\n\n## Procedure\n\n1. Require `work_events`.\n2. Normalize event ids, titles, timestamps, links, and summaries.\n3. Remove duplicate event ids.\n4. Classify shipped items, blockers, risks, and next actions.\n5. Emit a `source_map` for every digest item.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `work_events`: array or object containing bounded events.\n- `digest_policy`: optional period and grouping preferences.\n\n## Outputs\n\n- `shipped`, `blockers`, `risks`, `next_actions`.\n- `source_map`: digest item to input event mapping.\n- `evidence`: event counts, duplicate count, and classification rules.\n\n",
                  "profile_document":  "skill: standup-digest\nversion: \"0.1.0\"\n\ncatalog:\n  kind: skill\n  audience: public\n  visibility: public\n  role: canonical\n\nharness:\n  cases:\n    - name: standup-digest-sealed-digest\n      runner: digest\n      inputs:\n        work_events:\n          - id: pr_1\n            type: github_pr\n            title: Merged Prefect template\n            status: merged\n            timestamp: \"2026-06-20T08:00:00Z\"\n          - id: ci_1\n            type: build\n            title: Windows build failed\n            summary: CI failed and needs approval to rerun.\n          - id: note_1\n            type: note\n            title: Follow up with maintainer\n            summary: Next action is review feedback tomorrow.\n        digest_policy:\n          period: \"2026-06-20\"\n      expect:\n        status: sealed\n        receipt:\n          schema: runx.receipt.v1\n    - name: standup-digest-duplicate-noisy-input\n      runner: digest\n      inputs:\n        work_events:\n          - id: dup_1\n            title: Merged docs PR\n            status: merged\n          - id: dup_1\n            title: Merged docs PR\n            status: merged\n          - id: noise_1\n            title: FYI\n            summary: No action.\n      expect:\n        status: sealed\n        receipt:\n          schema: runx.receipt.v1\n\nrunners:\n  digest:\n    default: true\n    type: cli-tool\n    command: node\n    args:\n      - run.mjs\n    outputs:\n      status: string\n      period: string\n      shipped: object\n      blockers: object\n      risks: object\n      next_actions: object\n      source_map: object\n      evidence: object\n    artifacts:\n      wrap_as: standup_digest_packet\n      packet: runx.ops.standup_digest.v1\n    inputs:\n      work_events:\n        type: json\n        required: true\n        description: Bounded GitHub, issue, build, and note events.\n      digest_policy:\n        type: json\n        required: false\n        description: Period and grouping preferences.\n\n",
